@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-11 - Stripe Payment Processing

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Checkout / Payment UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail, coupons" as DB
participant "Stripe Gateway" as Stripe_Gateway

Actor -> FE: Start UC-11
FE -> API: POST /payments/stripe/create-intent + POST /payments/stripe/confirm
API -> Service: Execute Stripe Payment Processing
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail, coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service -> Stripe_Gateway: Create/confirm/refund payment
Stripe_Gateway --> Service: Stripe result
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Payment hoàn tất

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Thanh toán bị từ chối -> hiển thị lỗi thẻ
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Bill đã tạo
Post: Payment hoàn tất
Main flow:
1. System tạo Stripe PaymentIntent với amount, currency, metadata
2. Stripe trả về { clientSecret }
3. Frontend hiển thị Stripe Elements form (thẻ tín dụng)
4. User nhập thông tin thẻ và xác nhận
5. Frontend gọi stripe.confirmCardPayment(clientSecret)
6. Stripe xử lý thanh toán
7. Stripe gửi webhook POST /payments/stripe/webhook
8. System verify với stripe.webhooks.constructEvent()
9. System cập nhật bill status = PAID, giảm stock, gửi email
end note
@enduml
